    },
    "projectRepository": "https://github.com/BoxuChan/PluginList",
    "schema": "omega.evidence.presentation.v1",
    "website": {
      "description": "A side-bar dock for quick access to plugins, custom commands, and in-game macros.",
      "homepage": "",
      "images": [],
      "links": [
        {
          "kind": "source",
          "label": "Source",
          "url": "https://github.com/BoxuChan/PluginList"
        }
      ],
      "omegaBannerUrl": "",
      "readmeExcerpt": "# PluginList\n\nThe plugin has last been updated to function with **[Dalamud 15.0.0](https://github.com/goatcorp/Dalamud)** under FFXIV's **[7.5](https://na.finalfantasyxiv.com/lodestone/topics/detail/07320affa7e0fcd9685afcbe54fbf55405b6d822)** Patch.\n\n## _\"Your favorite tools, now just one hover away.\"_\n\nDo you find yourself opening the same plugins over and over, every single session? **PluginList** gives you a clean edge dock where your most-used tools are always ready, so that you can quickly open any plugin's config menu with a mere click instead of a command!\n\nPin your plugins, custom commands, and in-game macros once, then just hover the screen edge and click what you need to use right away.\n\n## Custom Repository Link\n\nYou may find the full list of available plugins on the **[Hako | 箱](https://github.com/BoxuChan/Hako)** GitHub page.\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/BoxuChan/Hako/main/repo.json\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n- **/pluginlist**: Opens the settings window.\n- **/pl**: Alias for `/pluginlist`.\n\n## How to Use\n\n- Import the above repository into Dalamud Settings by going into **Experimental** > **Custom Plugin Repositories**.\n- Look for **PluginList** in the Dalamud Plugin Installer.\n- Install the plugin and open its settings with **/pluginlist**.\n- Pick your shortcuts from the **Plugins**, **Commands**, and **Macros** tabs.\n- Organize everything in **Organization** (Alphabetical or Manual Drag & Drop).\n- Hover your selected screen edge and use things instantly.\n\n## Main Categories\n\nPluginList is split into simple categories so setup stays clean and fast:\n\n| Category         | Description                                                                                                                                       |\n|------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| **Plugins**      | Shows all of your loaded plugins and lets you pin/unpin them from the hover dock.                                                                 |\n| **Commands**     | Lets you create named custom command shortcuts. Supports single-line or multi-line command text.                                                  |\n| **Macros**       | Lets you pin in-game macros (Individual and Shared) directly into the hover dock.                                                                 |\n| **Organization** | Lets you sort shortcuts alphabetically or manually via drag & drop, move items between Main and Unpinned, and assign custom shortcut text colors. |\n\n## Hover Dock Behavior\n\nThe hover dock is designed to stay out of the way until you need it:\n\n| Feature                  | Description                                                        |\n|--------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| **Edge Placement**       | Place the dock on Top, Bottom, Left, or Right.                     |\n| **Edge Offset Dragging** | Drag the dock header area to move it along the selected edge.      |\n| **Auto Expand/Collapse** | The dock expands while hovered and collapses when you move away.   |\n| **Quick Settings Access**| Click the gear icon inside the dock to open PluginList's settings. |\n\n## Shortcut Interaction\n\n| Shortcut Type   | Interaction                                                                                              |\n|-----------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| **Plugin**      | Left-click opens plugin main UI (or config if no main UI). Right-click opens config UI when available.   |\n| **Command**     | Left-click executes the saved command text.                                                              |\n| **Macro**       | Left-click executes the selected in-game macro.                                                          |",
      "title": "PluginList",
      "url": "https://github.com/BoxuChan/PluginList"
    }
  },
